# Design System Rules

## Token Definitions
- Primary design tokens live in `src/styles/globals.css`; typography, color, elevation, and radius values are exposed as CSS custom properties and re-exported through an inline Tailwind theme via `@theme inline`.
- The app enforces RTL defaults and Vazirmatn typography globally; a `@custom-variant dark` block and `.dark` class override handle theming without a separate token transformation pipeline.
- Tailwind v4 inherits the variables (e.g., `--color-background`) so Tailwind utilities stay in sync with the bespoke token set. Animation utility classes supplement these tokens in `src/styles/animations.css`.

