## Component Library
- Reusable primitives live in `src/components/ui/` and follow the shadcn/ui + Radix UI pairing. Each file exports a typed component plus variant helpers configured with `class-variance-authority`.
- Shared styling helpers use the `cn()` function (`src/components/ui/utils.ts`) to merge Tailwind classes safely.
- Figma-generated layouts/components are preserved under `src/imports/` alongside Radix components for parity when translating design nodes.

