## Icon System
- Standard icons come from `lucide-react` (see `src/components/ProductChip.tsx`, `ProductVisualization.tsx`, etc.), keeping stroke weight consistent with design.
- Figma exports complex glyphs into `src/imports/svg-*.ts`; generated components simply import a path map and render inline SVG wrapped in absolutely positioned divs, so preserve those modules when syncing with design updates.
- Naming follows Figma auto-export IDs (e.g., `svg-zajtydnsb9`); prefer wrapping them in higher-level UI components instead of renaming to avoid merge pain when re-exporting from Figma.

```1:3:src/components/ProductChip.tsx
